WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.160 --> 01:38.032
=Episode 26=

01:43.640 --> 01:44.519
It's you?

01:49.424 --> 01:52.620
(Double Happiness)

01:52.799 --> 01:53.879
Greetings, Mr. Yu.

02:09.560 --> 02:10.919
Who told you to dress like this?

02:15.719 --> 02:16.919
My aunt had planned

02:17.520 --> 02:19.439
to offer me to Lord Wei.

02:20.400 --> 02:21.879
Thanks to Miss Xie,

02:22.159 --> 02:23.360
I was saved.

02:24.520 --> 02:26.319
She even gave me this handkerchief

02:27.680 --> 02:29.000
to dry my tears.

02:29.840 --> 02:31.039
It is a pity, though.

02:31.400 --> 02:33.199
She can protect me for now,

02:34.000 --> 02:35.639
but not for the rest of my life.

02:37.800 --> 02:38.719
So

02:41.960 --> 02:43.719
you seem to be quite familiar
with Miss Xie.

02:48.479 --> 02:50.400
Mr. Yu, would you like to hear

02:51.520 --> 02:53.240
a story about her?

03:20.120 --> 03:20.800
Young Madam.

03:21.560 --> 03:22.400
Young Madam.

03:22.439 --> 03:24.039
Please don't forget your manners.

03:24.039 --> 03:24.479
Young Madam.

03:24.479 --> 03:25.639
Let her in.

03:26.800 --> 03:27.479
Yes.

03:33.759 --> 03:34.400
Mother.

03:36.520 --> 03:38.199
Why did you bring into this house

03:38.919 --> 03:40.400
someone Fu Tingyun had cast aside?

03:41.159 --> 03:43.479
Where does that leave the Yu family's
dignity?

03:44.680 --> 03:46.560
Do you despise me that much?

03:46.960 --> 03:48.360
Is it because of my humble birth?

03:48.800 --> 03:50.680
Because my father
is not from a noble house?

03:51.639 --> 03:52.680
Your birth,

03:52.680 --> 03:53.960
though not noble,

03:54.719 --> 03:56.439
is still above that of common folk.

03:56.639 --> 03:58.039
Your father is a great scholar.

03:58.039 --> 04:00.360
But Fu Tingyun is now a commoner.

04:00.759 --> 04:02.319
Her methods and strategy

04:02.879 --> 04:03.960
are stronger than yours.

04:03.960 --> 04:05.199
She can do

04:05.199 --> 04:06.400
what you can't.

04:06.520 --> 04:07.879
Miss Wu,

04:07.960 --> 04:09.199
though young,

04:09.360 --> 04:10.680
is far more sensible than you.

04:10.800 --> 04:12.560
Her birth is even more humble
than yours.

04:12.800 --> 04:14.759
I once felt the same way about you

04:14.960 --> 04:17.040
as you do about her now.

04:17.199 --> 04:18.759
I accepted you completely.

04:19.079 --> 04:20.160
In the end, we must all

04:20.160 --> 04:21.879
live under the same roof.

04:23.319 --> 04:25.120
That is a woman's fate.

04:32.079 --> 04:32.920
Mother.

04:33.319 --> 04:35.279
I will do as you say from now on.

04:35.839 --> 04:38.160
You are my only support in this family.

04:39.279 --> 04:41.319
Since you have already accepted me,

04:41.879 --> 04:43.680
why would you still do this?

04:44.279 --> 04:46.560
Why make Miss Wu a concubine?

04:48.160 --> 04:49.759
Madam Wu's great-grandmother

04:49.879 --> 04:51.759
was the Grand Empress Dowager's
wet nurse.

04:51.839 --> 04:53.560
So she can attend the palace banquet.

04:53.920 --> 04:56.160
She can speak to Her Majesty.

04:56.160 --> 04:57.439
If we forge that connection,

04:57.439 --> 04:58.360
it benefits the family

04:58.360 --> 04:59.519
and benefits you.

04:59.959 --> 05:01.480
You should think carefully

05:02.519 --> 05:03.800
about what you truly want.

05:19.040 --> 05:19.879
Rest assured.

05:20.560 --> 05:22.680
Even if Jingxiu leaves this family,

05:24.439 --> 05:25.800
you would still have me.

05:39.680 --> 05:41.839
Back then,
for the sake of family interests,

05:43.279 --> 05:45.160
you were willing to abandon Fu Tingyun.

05:45.439 --> 05:46.240
Now,

05:47.959 --> 05:49.959
you can abandon me too.

05:53.519 --> 05:55.439
I have already made myself clear.

05:55.839 --> 05:57.639
If you remain stubborn,

05:57.839 --> 05:59.360
you will only become a bitter woman.

05:59.720 --> 06:01.319
Instead, think back

06:02.839 --> 06:04.920
to why you married into the Yu family.

06:09.319 --> 06:11.079
If it was for love,

06:11.759 --> 06:13.000
that is

06:13.480 --> 06:14.519
no longer possible.

06:15.920 --> 06:18.040
If it was for dignity and respect,

06:18.279 --> 06:20.920
then you should not
be looking so defeated.

06:22.279 --> 06:23.120
Taking a concubine

06:23.439 --> 06:26.199
is merely a move
to protect the family's interests.

06:26.560 --> 06:28.439
It also preserves your honor and dignity

06:28.439 --> 06:29.920
as the Young Madam of the Yu family.

06:32.279 --> 06:34.120
You had best not hold me back.

06:36.319 --> 06:37.319
- Mother.
- Mozhan.

06:37.920 --> 06:39.519
Help the Young Madam back
and see to her grooming.

06:42.560 --> 06:43.439
Mother.

06:54.160 --> 06:55.959
There is still a long road ahead.

07:00.032 --> 07:02.288
(Double Happiness)

07:08.439 --> 07:10.879
Please, Commander Zhao, wash your hands.

07:17.480 --> 07:19.720
The bride and groom take their seats.

07:19.800 --> 07:21.319
May spring fill the world

07:21.319 --> 07:22.439
and blessings fill your home.

07:23.319 --> 07:24.800
May your union be harmonious.

07:24.800 --> 07:26.439
Now, the bride reveals her face.

07:26.839 --> 07:27.360
Come on.

07:30.160 --> 07:31.240
Now, drink the ceremonial wine together.

07:32.079 --> 07:33.519
The couple drinks together,

07:33.839 --> 07:35.439
never to part.

07:49.800 --> 07:50.560
And so,

07:50.560 --> 07:52.360
the bridal chamber rites are complete.

07:52.480 --> 07:54.040
Congratulations, you two newlyweds.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.279
May your hearts be as one

07:55.279 --> 07:56.560
and your bond stand through all of life.

08:17.160 --> 08:18.439
This very moment

08:19.040 --> 08:20.519
is what I dreamed of.

08:24.040 --> 08:25.800
When did you start dreaming

08:27.519 --> 08:28.920
of marrying me,

08:31.240 --> 08:32.480
Mr. Zhao?

08:33.480 --> 08:34.559
Still calling me Mr. Zhao?

08:43.480 --> 08:44.440
Ling.

08:55.279 --> 08:56.919
The first time you proposed,

09:01.279 --> 09:02.960
you said it was mutually beneficial,

09:04.919 --> 09:06.519
that you needed me as your husband.

09:07.720 --> 09:08.480
And I was

09:09.840 --> 09:11.120
both annoyed

09:12.440 --> 09:13.519
and yet overjoyed.

09:14.720 --> 09:16.679
Annoyed that you treated
such a momentous occasion

09:18.039 --> 09:19.120
as a mere transaction.

09:21.240 --> 09:22.519
But overjoyed

09:23.759 --> 09:25.000
that it was me.

09:29.279 --> 09:30.519
The second time was even more absurd.

09:32.440 --> 09:34.039
You said it was for convenience.

09:35.440 --> 09:37.799
You wouldn't even let me
prepare the proper betrothal rites.

09:39.120 --> 09:40.799
You insisted on getting married
in Ganlin Town.

09:43.120 --> 09:44.440
Thankfully, today,

09:46.639 --> 09:48.120
all my wishes have come true.

09:55.000 --> 09:56.039
Thankfully,

10:00.840 --> 10:02.320
whether it was back then

10:04.360 --> 10:05.480
or now,

10:07.559 --> 10:09.120
you would say yes.

10:11.279 --> 10:12.080
Wouldn't you?

10:28.480 --> 10:30.440
I will give you a lifetime of devotion

10:34.320 --> 10:35.720
in return for the knot we tied.

10:42.512 --> 10:48.300
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

10:48.336 --> 10:53.340
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

10:53.520 --> 10:56.110
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

10:57.500 --> 11:02.752
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

11:05.370 --> 11:12.288
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

11:13.740 --> 11:20.176
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

11:20.592 --> 11:24.160
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

11:24.608 --> 11:28.730
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

11:29.300 --> 11:34.944
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

11:54.512 --> 11:59.230
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

12:02.608 --> 12:06.880
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

12:08.800 --> 12:13.180
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

12:13.620 --> 12:16.160
♪Kept close within my heart♪

12:17.456 --> 12:22.250
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

12:25.440 --> 12:32.410
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

12:33.472 --> 12:39.740
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

12:40.740 --> 12:43.584
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

12:44.656 --> 12:48.800
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

12:49.220 --> 12:54.608
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

13:20.448 --> 13:23.580
(Yu Residence)

13:46.759 --> 13:47.360
Chengxin.

13:52.039 --> 13:52.679
Young Master.

13:53.039 --> 13:54.879
Who told you
to let someone into my study?

13:57.879 --> 13:58.759
Forgive me, Young Master.

13:59.559 --> 14:00.200
Get out.

14:08.840 --> 14:10.720
Mother could still offer me some words

14:12.200 --> 14:13.519
regarding the concubine.

14:16.639 --> 14:17.480
But you?

14:22.639 --> 14:24.440
You won't even talk to me.

14:26.360 --> 14:28.120
Are seven years of marriage

14:28.120 --> 14:29.720
really this fragile?

14:32.799 --> 14:33.919
I owe you an apology

14:35.960 --> 14:37.120
for taking a concubine.

14:37.440 --> 14:39.159
You have done far more than wrong me.

14:40.120 --> 14:41.399
You have been heartless!

14:43.960 --> 14:44.960
Heartless?

14:49.799 --> 14:51.120
But have you ever considered

14:53.399 --> 14:55.120
that I gave you more than enough time,

14:55.120 --> 14:56.320
more than enough chances?

14:56.320 --> 14:57.080
You were the one

14:59.840 --> 15:01.000
who failed to make me love you.

15:05.720 --> 15:07.519
What did I do wrong?

15:11.279 --> 15:13.159
What is it that she has and I don't?

15:22.120 --> 15:23.440
You are too ordinary.

15:25.279 --> 15:26.720
There are millions of people
in this world.

15:27.039 --> 15:28.440
Even if I lost you in a crowd,

15:28.440 --> 15:29.480
I wouldn't recognize you.

15:31.039 --> 15:32.080
Ordinary?

15:32.080 --> 15:32.759
That's right.

15:34.720 --> 15:35.720
But rest assured,

15:36.120 --> 15:37.799
Wu is ordinary too.

15:40.039 --> 15:40.759
Besides,

15:46.480 --> 15:48.360
you are still my principal wife.

15:48.879 --> 15:50.840
I will give you the dignity you deserve.

15:52.039 --> 15:53.399
But what brought us here

15:53.519 --> 15:55.399
was the choice we made back then.

15:56.360 --> 15:57.399
You chose the Yu family,

15:58.159 --> 15:59.039
and I chose you.

16:01.000 --> 16:02.120
The pain we endure today

16:04.720 --> 16:06.879
is simply the price we each must pay.

16:09.840 --> 16:10.519
From now on,

16:13.440 --> 16:15.080
do not enter my study again.

16:29.679 --> 16:30.440
Young Madam.

16:41.519 --> 16:43.120
I never truly loved orchids.

16:45.840 --> 16:46.919
But because of him,

16:48.440 --> 16:49.919
I deceived myself.

16:51.120 --> 16:53.639
I abandoned the daffodil
and pretended to love the orchid.

16:54.840 --> 16:56.679
No matter how much I tried
to please him,

16:58.480 --> 17:00.440
I could never win his affection.

17:00.879 --> 17:01.879
In the end,

17:04.119 --> 17:06.640
all I was to him was "ordinary."

17:08.960 --> 17:11.200
I am too ordinary!

17:13.759 --> 17:16.000
I am too ordinary!

17:18.039 --> 17:19.799
Too ordinary.

17:21.160 --> 17:22.920
Miss Wu, don't rush.

17:24.200 --> 17:25.160
Miss Wu.

17:25.160 --> 17:25.880
Back then,

17:25.880 --> 17:26.960
you went to great lengths

17:26.960 --> 17:28.720
to avoid marrying into the Wei family.

17:29.160 --> 17:30.039
Now,

17:30.039 --> 17:32.119
why would you willingly
become a concubine in the Yu family?

17:32.200 --> 17:33.880
Madam Wei was born into nobility.

17:34.160 --> 17:35.480
If I had gone to the Wei family,

17:35.480 --> 17:37.519
I would have been under her thumb
for life.

17:38.279 --> 17:39.519
But the Yu family is different.

17:39.680 --> 17:41.640
Young Madam Yu may be proud
of her talent,

17:42.720 --> 17:44.359
but she does not have
the Old Madam's favor.

17:45.160 --> 17:45.960
Besides,

17:46.160 --> 17:47.519
Madam Yu is a reasonable woman.

17:48.279 --> 17:50.200
As long as I benefit the Yu family,

17:50.440 --> 17:51.880
she will not treat me unfairly.

17:53.759 --> 17:54.279
Then,

17:54.279 --> 17:55.559
what about Young Lord Yu...?

17:56.319 --> 17:58.000
I only need to do my part

17:59.440 --> 18:00.559
and please him.

18:00.720 --> 18:01.559
My life

18:01.559 --> 18:02.839
won't be too difficult.

18:06.640 --> 18:07.240
Look.

18:08.519 --> 18:09.319
Now,

18:09.680 --> 18:10.880
we have everything we need.

18:11.519 --> 18:12.839
We can even eat our fill.

18:14.000 --> 18:15.240
What more could I ask for?

18:18.680 --> 18:20.559
They all want me to be like Miss Xie.

18:21.119 --> 18:23.359
I suppose I have caught
some of her fortune too.

18:27.079 --> 18:28.000
Miss Wu,

18:28.400 --> 18:29.400
you are right.

18:29.720 --> 18:31.039
We have finally come

18:31.039 --> 18:32.119
to a comfortable place.

18:33.720 --> 18:34.279
Here.

18:35.359 --> 18:36.039
Eat more.

18:37.799 --> 18:39.200
We can finally have enough to eat.

18:39.920 --> 18:41.039
So delicious.

18:49.279 --> 18:50.160
Miss Wu.

18:50.480 --> 18:51.799
Are you feeling better?

18:54.079 --> 18:55.039
Miss Wu.

18:57.160 --> 18:58.160
Have some water.

18:59.519 --> 19:01.720
I told you not to eat so much.

19:10.180 --> 19:14.720
(Double Happiness)

19:43.640 --> 19:44.799
It's windy today.

19:45.160 --> 19:47.000
I've had some hot soup prepared.

19:47.559 --> 19:48.880
After court,

19:48.880 --> 19:49.720
come back and have some.

19:58.920 --> 20:00.440
Your thoughtfulness, my dear,

20:01.759 --> 20:03.440
makes it hard for me to leave.

20:08.079 --> 20:09.319
If you delay the morning court,

20:10.400 --> 20:12.039
the censors will surely report you.

20:13.440 --> 20:14.000
I'm off.

20:40.200 --> 20:42.079
Wang Yi,
Commander of the Gandu Garrison,

20:42.160 --> 20:43.960
has served fifteen years at the border.

20:44.119 --> 20:46.319
He has repeatedly driven back
the Wangur invaders,

20:46.440 --> 20:48.440
preserving the peace of our frontiers.

20:48.480 --> 20:50.039
His merits are for the realm.

20:50.279 --> 20:50.960
Now,

20:50.960 --> 20:53.759
he is hereby conferred the title
of Junior First-Rank Ronglu Grandee

20:53.839 --> 20:55.160
and granted an imperial patent.

20:55.759 --> 20:57.920
His wife, virtuous and worthy,

20:58.079 --> 21:01.039
is hereby conferred the title
of Junior First-Rank Imperial Lady.

21:01.640 --> 21:03.640
Mo Yi, the guerrilla general,

21:03.920 --> 21:04.519
is granted

21:04.519 --> 21:07.319
the title of Senior Fourth-Rank General
of Illustrious Might.

21:07.480 --> 21:10.799
All other officers shall be promoted
one rank in their substantive posts

21:11.400 --> 21:12.119
and granted

21:12.119 --> 21:13.880
eighty taels of silver.

21:14.039 --> 21:16.440
I thank Your Majesty
for your gracious favor.

21:26.000 --> 21:27.440
Having received Your Majesty's
great kindness,

21:27.799 --> 21:29.440
I would not dare to make
further requests.

21:30.319 --> 21:31.160
But

21:31.279 --> 21:33.839
my old wounds truly make it hard
to carry on.

21:34.440 --> 21:35.400
I take the liberty

21:35.759 --> 21:37.400
to ask Your Majesty for permission

21:38.119 --> 21:39.559
to remain in the capital

21:39.880 --> 21:41.359
for a few days to recuperate.

21:41.640 --> 21:42.279
Granted.

21:43.440 --> 21:45.279
Returning to the capital is no easy task
for northwestern officers.

21:45.839 --> 21:46.759
All of you

21:46.759 --> 21:48.079
shall stay with Commander Wang

21:48.079 --> 21:48.720
in the capital.

21:49.200 --> 21:50.200
Spend more time

21:50.200 --> 21:51.720
with your families.

21:52.079 --> 21:53.759
Thank you, Your Majesty.

21:58.880 --> 22:00.240
Five years.

22:01.400 --> 22:03.079
Five long years.

22:04.400 --> 22:06.319
Military provisions were withheld.

22:06.440 --> 22:08.720
Border soldiers went hungry.

22:09.279 --> 22:11.440
Our brothers fought on empty stomachs.

22:12.759 --> 22:14.920
Can these rewards and riches

22:14.920 --> 22:16.559
really cover that up?

22:19.799 --> 22:20.480
No.

22:21.720 --> 22:24.200
I must uncover the truth.

22:24.720 --> 22:26.279
Otherwise, in the next five years,

22:26.279 --> 22:28.440
will our soldiers go hungry again?

22:31.400 --> 22:32.279
Yes.

22:33.359 --> 22:34.079
My Lord,

22:37.079 --> 22:38.640
the man behind Li Mao is Yu Guodong.

22:38.640 --> 22:40.119
But the Yu family has deep roots.

22:41.039 --> 22:42.279
Without absolute certainty,

22:42.279 --> 22:43.319
a rash move

22:43.759 --> 22:44.640
would only

22:45.200 --> 22:46.400
tip off the enemy

22:46.960 --> 22:48.240
and ruin the greater plan.

22:53.279 --> 22:54.079
Alright.

22:55.799 --> 22:57.759
Let us wait and see.

22:59.640 --> 23:01.680
We wait for the right timing,

23:03.359 --> 23:04.839
the right position,
and the right people.

23:10.519 --> 23:12.720
Good heavens!

23:12.960 --> 23:16.079
This will be the death of me!

23:16.240 --> 23:18.440
This drought came without warning.

23:18.920 --> 23:21.000
His Majesty has summoned
the Grand Secretariat

23:21.000 --> 23:22.440
to discuss countermeasures.

23:24.039 --> 23:25.640
On such major occasions,

23:25.720 --> 23:27.759
that favored official
would always be present.

23:27.920 --> 23:29.000
But today,

23:30.440 --> 23:32.519
not a trace of him was seen.

23:33.200 --> 23:34.559
Clearly,

23:38.160 --> 23:40.359
your strategy

23:41.680 --> 23:44.279
is beginning to take effect.

23:47.000 --> 23:48.640
That move with Her Majesty

23:48.640 --> 23:49.920
has paid off.

23:49.920 --> 23:50.880
Yesterday,

23:51.400 --> 23:52.519
I went over the accounts

23:52.839 --> 23:53.839
with His Majesty.

23:54.119 --> 23:56.640
The imperial treasury has only
over four hundred thousand taels left.

23:57.000 --> 23:59.519
If we don't act swiftly
on the salt reform,

23:59.680 --> 24:00.759
forget disaster relief.

24:01.359 --> 24:04.000
We won't even have funds
for future expenses.

24:04.359 --> 24:06.839
So I seized the chance of raising funds

24:07.519 --> 24:08.960
and proposed to His Majesty

24:09.279 --> 24:12.119
extending the salt reform nationwide.

24:12.400 --> 24:13.400
Guess what?

24:14.200 --> 24:15.640
From his tone,

24:18.920 --> 24:21.839
he seems to be relenting.

24:24.319 --> 24:24.960
Here, darling.

24:28.440 --> 24:30.039
His Majesty is in urgent need of silver.

24:30.720 --> 24:32.720
Whoever can collect the funds

24:33.000 --> 24:35.039
will be the true favored official.

24:36.680 --> 24:38.880
As long as he loses the Emperor's favor,

24:41.400 --> 24:42.839
our plan

24:44.400 --> 24:45.839
will succeed.

24:51.200 --> 24:52.559
Your Majesty, I beg to report.

24:52.920 --> 24:54.920
Yesterday's small court session
reached a conclusion.

24:55.400 --> 24:57.759
The number of drought victims
has exceeded eight hundred thousand.

24:58.440 --> 24:59.799
I have checked the imperial granaries.

25:00.240 --> 25:02.200
Their reserves
are less than ten thousand dan.

25:02.400 --> 25:03.720
Treasury silver is limited.

25:04.640 --> 25:05.680
The Ministry of Works has approved

25:05.680 --> 25:07.279
a transfer of one hundred thousand taels

25:07.279 --> 25:08.799
for the imperial mausoleum fund.

25:08.799 --> 25:10.079
That must not be touched.

25:10.240 --> 25:11.000
I propose

25:11.759 --> 25:13.119
that we implement

25:13.440 --> 25:15.759
the new salt reform
nationwide immediately.

25:15.960 --> 25:16.839
If approved,

25:17.079 --> 25:19.759
the salt merchants' silver will flow
into the Salt Transport Bureau at once.

25:20.240 --> 25:21.519
The eight hundred thousand victims

25:21.519 --> 25:22.359
will have

25:22.359 --> 25:23.720
their immediate needs met.

25:23.960 --> 25:25.640
Yes, Your Majesty.

25:25.640 --> 25:26.440
Yes.

25:31.759 --> 25:32.680
Your Majesty, I beg to report.

25:33.319 --> 25:34.839
The old salt law has been in place
for a hundred years.

25:35.160 --> 25:36.240
Traders and civilians in the northwest

25:36.319 --> 25:38.000
transport grain to the border
in exchange for salt permits.

25:38.440 --> 25:39.960
Thus border grain reserves
have been abundant.

25:40.240 --> 25:41.880
If we suddenly switch
to silver payments,

25:42.119 --> 25:43.759
the livelihoods of the northwest people
will be destroyed.

25:44.000 --> 25:45.440
The border grain routes
will surely collapse.

25:45.920 --> 25:46.559
Border troops

25:47.279 --> 25:48.400
will have no provisions.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.319
Trade routes will be cut off.

25:49.960 --> 25:51.559
The northwest will fall into ruin.

25:53.440 --> 25:54.759
With border defenses weakened,

25:54.759 --> 25:55.160
I fear...

26:00.480 --> 26:01.839
the Wangur will attack.

26:03.759 --> 26:04.680
Commander Zhao,

26:04.960 --> 26:06.359
you come from the northwest,

26:06.359 --> 26:08.079
and your heart remains with it.

26:08.279 --> 26:09.559
But do not forget this.

26:09.960 --> 26:12.160
The lives
of the northwest people matter.

26:12.400 --> 26:14.680
Are the lives of those other victims
any less important?

26:15.359 --> 26:16.680
Across the realm,

26:16.759 --> 26:19.160
there are millions of mouths to feed.

26:20.480 --> 26:22.400
The drought is now ravaging the land.

26:23.039 --> 26:24.640
The dead lie scattered everywhere.

26:26.400 --> 26:27.319
Zhao Ling.

26:27.799 --> 26:29.079
Apart from the salt reform,

26:29.440 --> 26:31.880
do you have any other way
to raise funds?

26:35.240 --> 26:36.119
Zhao Ling.

26:36.720 --> 26:39.200
Seven years ago,
when you fled with the refugees,

26:40.119 --> 26:41.440
you saw with your own eyes

26:43.240 --> 26:45.440
bodies lying along the roads,

26:45.440 --> 26:47.640
people digging up grass to eat.

26:47.799 --> 26:49.440
Now that you have become an official,

26:49.839 --> 26:50.720
have you forgotten

26:51.279 --> 26:54.160
the common folk
who once ate grass with you?

27:02.519 --> 27:03.279
Your Majesty,

27:03.920 --> 27:06.079
every word Commander Zhao said is true.

27:06.079 --> 27:07.720
His unwavering loyalty
is clear for all to see.

27:08.200 --> 27:08.839
Your Majesty,

27:09.480 --> 27:11.160
the three northwestern garrisons rely

27:11.440 --> 27:12.359
on salt merchants

27:12.359 --> 27:13.839
for thirty percent of their supplies.

27:14.200 --> 27:15.400
If the salt reform is pushed through,

27:15.400 --> 27:16.559
and the grain routes collapse,

27:16.839 --> 27:20.000
the Wangur mounted warriors
will surely sweep in

27:20.000 --> 27:21.440
and attack the border.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.200
Your Majesty,

27:23.880 --> 27:25.720
disaster relief is an immediate concern,

27:26.200 --> 27:28.200
and border defense is a long-term one.

27:28.200 --> 27:30.559
Both must be taken into account.

27:35.200 --> 27:35.920
I

27:36.160 --> 27:37.440
stake my head on this.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.720
I beg Your Majesty

27:38.720 --> 27:40.000
to postpone the salt reform

27:40.279 --> 27:41.160
and give the northwest

27:41.160 --> 27:42.839
a chance to catch its breath.

27:46.000 --> 27:46.559
I

27:47.440 --> 27:49.039
have already made myself clear.

27:50.119 --> 27:52.240
The most pressing matter now

27:52.240 --> 27:53.400
is the drought!

27:54.279 --> 27:56.440
How dare you bargain with me here?

27:57.119 --> 27:57.759
Guards.

27:58.039 --> 27:59.079
Drag him out

27:59.240 --> 28:00.440
and give him thirty strokes.

28:01.039 --> 28:01.680
Your Majesty!

28:02.079 --> 28:02.799
Your Majesty!

28:03.079 --> 28:05.680
- I speak from the heart, Your Majesty!
- Out!

28:05.880 --> 28:07.079
Your Majesty!

28:12.559 --> 28:13.319
Zhao Ling.

28:13.720 --> 28:15.720
I appoint you
as Assistant Censor-in-Chief.

28:15.799 --> 28:16.960
You will take full charge

28:16.960 --> 28:17.759
of implementing

28:17.759 --> 28:19.119
the salt reform nationwide.

28:19.119 --> 28:20.200
If your delays

28:20.200 --> 28:21.640
leave us short of funds,

28:21.640 --> 28:22.119
I

28:22.480 --> 28:23.559
will hold you personally responsible.

28:24.440 --> 28:25.200
Yes,

28:29.440 --> 28:30.359
Your Majesty.

28:33.400 --> 28:36.400
Though you didn't get the post
of Imperial Salt Censor,

28:37.759 --> 28:38.759
the family

28:38.880 --> 28:41.119
has secured you a position

28:41.720 --> 28:42.880
as a Secretary
in the Ministry of Revenue.

28:43.480 --> 28:45.039
Why have you been so listless

28:45.039 --> 28:47.440
these past few days?

28:49.279 --> 28:50.799
My learning is shallow.

28:51.759 --> 28:53.079
I fear I am not up to the task.

28:57.200 --> 28:59.279
If Zhao Ling heard you say that...

29:00.079 --> 29:01.039
- Grand Secretary Yu.
- Grand Secretary Yu.

29:06.480 --> 29:08.480
He would laugh at you.

29:09.440 --> 29:10.839
- I have duties at the ministry.
- Grand Secretary Yu.

29:10.839 --> 29:12.119
Grand Secretary Yu.

29:12.119 --> 29:13.200
I would like to take my leave.

29:14.000 --> 29:15.839
If you refuse to heed my words today,

29:15.839 --> 29:18.000
you will suffer
all the more for it tomorrow.

29:18.839 --> 29:19.920
Do you think Zhao Ling's

29:19.920 --> 29:21.400
predicament in court today

29:21.400 --> 29:23.519
was because his learning was shallow?

29:23.680 --> 29:25.200
It was because no one taught him.

29:25.200 --> 29:25.720
Father.

29:27.480 --> 29:29.880
The Ministry of Revenue is waiting
for the accounts to be verified.

29:33.680 --> 29:35.559
Go.

29:35.559 --> 29:36.920
Go and see to your important matters.

29:38.119 --> 29:38.960
I take my leave, Father.

29:44.519 --> 29:45.240
Young Master.

29:45.799 --> 29:47.759
Every day after court,
you take a detour to pass by here.

29:48.279 --> 29:49.400
Why do you put yourself through this?

29:56.720 --> 29:58.880
(Xie Residence)

30:02.799 --> 30:04.240
At court today,

30:04.839 --> 30:06.440
Zhao Ling was reprimanded in public.

30:06.720 --> 30:08.359
His future looks uncertain.

30:11.119 --> 30:12.440
They're newly married,

30:13.160 --> 30:14.440
and already this has happened.

30:15.519 --> 30:16.559
I wonder

30:17.880 --> 30:19.359
if she'll regret her choice.

30:23.440 --> 30:24.319
Miss Wu.

30:25.000 --> 30:25.880
Miss Wu.

30:25.960 --> 30:27.640
Young Master's carriage
has just entered the front courtyard.

30:29.920 --> 30:31.279
He and his father
serve at court together.

30:31.640 --> 30:33.480
Master always returns earlier than him.

30:36.480 --> 30:37.839
Did something happen

30:37.839 --> 30:39.240
with Young Master today?

30:41.200 --> 30:43.079
Which direction did his carriage
come from?

30:44.480 --> 30:45.279
The north.

30:47.319 --> 30:49.079
Shijia Hutong is also in the north.

30:54.559 --> 30:55.400
Join me.

30:55.720 --> 30:56.759
Thank you, Miss Wu.

31:31.440 --> 31:32.920
Did something happen

31:34.079 --> 31:35.319
at court today?

31:37.359 --> 31:38.359
Grand Secretary Yu

31:39.440 --> 31:41.680
used the drought
to push for the salt reform.

31:42.079 --> 31:43.640
Mo is straightforward.

31:44.640 --> 31:46.039
To protect the northwest's grain supply,

31:48.240 --> 31:50.039
he received thirty strokes
from His Majesty.

31:50.720 --> 31:52.440
How badly is General Mo hurt?

31:53.839 --> 31:55.359
His flesh is badly torn.

31:56.720 --> 31:58.240
He'll be bedridden
for at least half a month.

31:59.519 --> 32:01.440
Commander Wang cannot speak up either.

32:02.119 --> 32:04.519
If the northwestern commanders
present a joint petition now,

32:07.319 --> 32:09.440
it will only trouble His Majesty
further.

32:20.279 --> 32:21.440
As for Mo,

32:23.680 --> 32:24.880
if you have time tomorrow,

32:25.559 --> 32:26.799
go to the Mo household.

32:27.440 --> 32:28.519
Bring more wound salve.

32:28.720 --> 32:29.519
Don't worry.

32:30.720 --> 32:31.519
I know all that.

32:33.480 --> 32:35.200
What disturbs me most

32:36.440 --> 32:38.680
is that His Majesty has already agreed
with Grand Secretary Yu.

32:41.440 --> 32:42.960
If I raise any objection,

32:44.839 --> 32:47.200
it means I care only about the northwest
and neglect the rest of the realm.

32:47.799 --> 32:49.480
The lives
of the northwestern people matter.

32:49.920 --> 32:51.000
But I also understand

32:51.000 --> 32:52.880
that the lives of all drought victims
matter even more.

32:54.079 --> 32:55.960
But how to strike the right balance,

33:00.920 --> 33:03.160
I still have no clear idea.

33:16.640 --> 33:18.680
You and I climbed up from the bottom.

33:18.960 --> 33:20.400
We know the suffering
of the victims best.

33:22.720 --> 33:25.000
You are not someone who only cares
about his own advancement.

33:25.559 --> 33:26.440
His Majesty is no tyrant

33:26.519 --> 33:28.839
who ignores the border either.

33:29.839 --> 33:31.079
Today's conflict

33:32.680 --> 33:34.519
is simply because the situation

33:34.759 --> 33:35.880
is far too difficult.

33:42.400 --> 33:43.960
At the small court session yesterday,

33:44.440 --> 33:45.839
His Majesty did not summon me.

33:48.319 --> 33:49.440
Help me think.

33:51.759 --> 33:53.640
Where exactly does the problem lie?

34:05.279 --> 34:06.680
Let me lean on you for a while.

34:11.719 --> 34:13.519
At court today,

34:19.199 --> 34:20.960
I almost couldn't hold it together.

34:28.119 --> 34:29.519
In court,

34:30.679 --> 34:31.920
things can change in an instant.

34:34.199 --> 34:35.119
I will face them

34:36.440 --> 34:37.559
with you.

34:54.920 --> 34:56.280
You tactless fool.

34:56.360 --> 34:57.440
Did you have a death wish,

34:57.679 --> 34:58.880
defying the Emperor in public?

35:00.159 --> 35:01.559
What do you know?

35:01.840 --> 35:04.440
Someone from the northwest army
had to step up.

35:05.000 --> 35:05.920
We can't let Zhao

35:05.920 --> 35:07.159
go into battle alone

35:07.159 --> 35:08.400
without anyone backing him up.

35:08.840 --> 35:10.360
Does Zhao Ling even need you
to back him up?

35:10.440 --> 35:11.880
You both fought for five years.

35:12.320 --> 35:13.880
See what he has accomplished.
Now look at you.

35:14.280 --> 35:15.880
Commander Zhao's career has flourished.

35:17.159 --> 35:17.880
Now,

35:17.880 --> 35:19.480
he's the Emperor's favorite.

35:19.719 --> 35:20.320
And you?

35:21.400 --> 35:22.760
First you got rewarded,

35:23.639 --> 35:24.840
and now you get beaten.

35:26.480 --> 35:28.320
Zhao Ling is His Majesty's trusted aide.

35:28.320 --> 35:29.199
It's different.

35:29.760 --> 35:31.000
You've been with His Majesty

35:31.000 --> 35:32.119
even longer than Zhao Ling.

35:34.519 --> 35:35.519
Easy.

35:35.519 --> 35:36.880
Are you trying to kill your own husband?

35:37.079 --> 35:38.480
With you being so useless,

35:39.039 --> 35:40.480
if His Majesty didn't kill you,

35:40.559 --> 35:41.480
I'd poison you myself.

35:44.880 --> 35:45.480
Mother.

35:46.079 --> 35:48.079
Madam Wang and my sworn mother
are both in the front hall.

35:48.519 --> 35:49.480
Go attend to them first.

35:49.480 --> 35:50.239
I'll be there shortly.

35:55.679 --> 35:56.840
I'll deal with you when I get back.

35:59.320 --> 36:00.480
Take this in to your father.

36:01.360 --> 36:02.280
Please, have a seat.

36:02.280 --> 36:03.360
In this scorching heat,

36:03.440 --> 36:05.199
it's so kind of you two to think of us.

36:08.719 --> 36:09.440
Madam,

36:09.440 --> 36:10.719
it hurts so much!

36:10.719 --> 36:12.239
I'm dying!

36:12.760 --> 36:13.639
What are you yelling about?

36:13.880 --> 36:15.239
I'm not dead yet!

36:18.119 --> 36:19.519
Please excuse us.

36:19.519 --> 36:20.440
It couldn't be

36:20.440 --> 36:21.760
the ointment we just sent in...

36:21.760 --> 36:22.280
No.

36:22.400 --> 36:24.719
I was just a bit rough
when I applied the medicine.

36:29.119 --> 36:31.079
We came to see how you were doing.

36:31.239 --> 36:32.679
It's a relief

36:32.679 --> 36:33.559
to see you doing well.

36:34.239 --> 36:35.840
We're not the type
to worry about losing face.

36:35.840 --> 36:37.159
A few beatings are nothing.

36:40.519 --> 36:41.440
But you...

36:41.960 --> 36:43.119
I heard

36:43.760 --> 36:45.440
His Majesty struck Mo Yi on the surface,

36:45.519 --> 36:46.559
but his true target

36:47.920 --> 36:49.519
was Commander Zhao.

36:49.920 --> 36:51.360
The Emperor's will is hard to read.

36:52.079 --> 36:53.239
For now,

36:53.800 --> 36:55.039
I have no clear answer.

36:55.679 --> 36:56.679
When you got married,

36:56.679 --> 36:57.960
His Majesty didn't send anyone.

36:57.960 --> 36:59.039
I felt something was off then.

36:59.960 --> 37:01.719
Do you know anyone in the capital

37:01.719 --> 37:02.880
who could gather information?

37:04.928 --> 37:07.340
(Xie Residence)

37:09.519 --> 37:10.199
Madam.

37:11.119 --> 37:12.639
Concubine Wu sent you an invitation

37:12.760 --> 37:14.239
(Invitation)
to Hefeng Garden to admire the lotuses.

37:15.800 --> 37:17.000
Admire the lotuses?

37:19.000 --> 37:20.360
It's already late summer.

37:20.360 --> 37:21.719
The lotuses are almost gone.

37:22.039 --> 37:23.440
What is there left to admire?

37:24.639 --> 37:26.079
This Concubine Wu...

37:26.079 --> 37:27.159
Every time you meet,

37:27.280 --> 37:28.400
she has something to ask of you.

37:29.239 --> 37:30.239
Now,

37:30.360 --> 37:31.880
she is already part of the Yu family.

37:32.320 --> 37:33.239
We

37:33.360 --> 37:35.079
shouldn't get involved in their affairs.

37:38.920 --> 37:39.840
You're right.

37:41.559 --> 37:43.280
Now that she's part of the Yu family,

37:43.800 --> 37:44.760
could it be

37:45.239 --> 37:46.320
that she has some news?

37:53.000 --> 37:54.440
(Hefeng Garden)
You didn't ask me here

37:55.079 --> 37:56.800
just for the lotuses, did you?

38:01.639 --> 38:03.199
You may not know this, Madam.

38:04.920 --> 38:06.559
Though I've married into the Yu family,

38:07.199 --> 38:08.280
I still have to

38:08.360 --> 38:09.440
look to others for permission,

38:09.440 --> 38:11.320
even for something
as small as using ice.

38:11.960 --> 38:12.840
These days

38:12.960 --> 38:14.440
are truly hard to bear.

38:17.840 --> 38:19.360
Last time we met,

38:20.239 --> 38:22.119
you said you couldn't
even get enough to eat.

38:23.280 --> 38:25.079
Now you even get to use ice.

38:27.719 --> 38:29.360
Fan and I are old acquaintances.

38:30.159 --> 38:32.440
I know what she's like.

38:32.719 --> 38:34.800
She may be harsh with you,

38:35.519 --> 38:37.039
but withholding your food
and necessities

38:37.039 --> 38:37.960
is not something she would do.

38:44.000 --> 38:45.519
The real reason I came today

38:45.639 --> 38:47.679
is to ask a favor

38:48.159 --> 38:49.639
of you, Madam.

38:50.679 --> 38:52.320
I'd like to learn
how to make sesame flatbread.

38:53.199 --> 38:54.440
The same kind

38:54.800 --> 38:56.480
you used to make in Ganlin Town.

39:04.639 --> 39:05.880
How did you know about that?

39:07.039 --> 39:08.440
Because I noticed

39:08.760 --> 39:10.000
that Young Madam Yu

39:10.000 --> 39:11.800
hates sesame flatbread above all else.

39:12.320 --> 39:14.159
But at Ji's first-year banquet,

39:15.199 --> 39:17.159
a sesame flatbread dish
suddenly appeared.

39:18.320 --> 39:19.880
And you come from the northwest.

39:19.880 --> 39:21.159
After some thought,

39:21.280 --> 39:23.360
I realized Young Master
must have had it added because of you.

39:24.480 --> 39:25.800
But rest assured, Madam.

39:26.400 --> 39:27.679
I won't take your help for granted.

39:28.079 --> 39:29.559
I'd like to make a trade with you.

39:30.800 --> 39:32.000
I can tell you

39:33.440 --> 39:34.360
how Commander Zhao

39:34.800 --> 39:36.480
fell out of the Emperor's favor.

39:40.119 --> 39:41.199
It was because my aunt

39:41.199 --> 39:42.920
and Madam Yu plotted against you.

39:43.400 --> 39:45.159
By custom, the Grand Empress Dowager
must be buried

39:45.159 --> 39:46.119
in the consorts' mausoleum.

39:46.440 --> 39:48.159
(Hefeng Garden)
She asked every year

39:48.440 --> 39:49.760
to be buried with the founding emperor.

39:49.840 --> 39:50.920
Her son,

39:51.000 --> 39:52.760
the late Emperor, never granted it.

39:53.360 --> 39:54.639
Before his death,

39:54.639 --> 39:56.119
he left a decree

39:56.840 --> 39:58.000
stating

39:58.320 --> 40:00.440
that ancestral laws must not be broken.

40:01.719 --> 40:02.559
And so,

40:03.000 --> 40:04.159
Her Majesty

40:04.159 --> 40:05.800
began to pressure her grandson.

40:06.559 --> 40:07.440
She said

40:08.679 --> 40:10.119
one cannot honor only one's father

40:10.480 --> 40:11.559
and neglect one's grandmother.

40:12.559 --> 40:14.480
That was the true purpose

40:15.119 --> 40:16.239
behind that birthday banquet.

40:18.760 --> 40:20.239
(As descendants,)

40:20.400 --> 40:22.000
(we cannot honor only our father)

40:22.199 --> 40:24.199
(and neglect our grandmother.)

40:28.360 --> 40:29.800
You're an interesting one.

40:30.679 --> 40:31.800
Making a trade

40:32.039 --> 40:33.320
by showing all your cards.

40:38.239 --> 40:40.239
Because I trust your reputation, Madam.

40:42.719 --> 40:43.760
So, Madam,

40:44.119 --> 40:45.960
will you teach me
how to make sesame flatbread now?

40:52.760 --> 40:54.840
But I don't want to make this trade.

40:55.719 --> 40:57.519
I no longer wish to have

40:58.480 --> 41:00.039
any involvement with Yu Jingxiu.

41:00.440 --> 41:01.440
Then how about

41:02.079 --> 41:03.440
I put it another way?

41:05.400 --> 41:07.159
Can you promise me

41:07.679 --> 41:09.000
that the young master of the Yu family

41:09.320 --> 41:11.639
will never taste your flatbread?

41:18.140 --> 41:20.176
(Next Episode)

41:20.800 --> 41:22.639
To gain the Emperor's favor,

41:23.079 --> 41:25.440
Zhao Ling dared to take on
the imperial mausoleum project.

41:25.880 --> 41:28.519
Since he insists
on jumping into the flames,

41:28.760 --> 41:30.400
we might as well

41:30.800 --> 41:33.480
add fuel to the fire.

41:34.039 --> 41:35.320
Where will the million taels

41:35.320 --> 41:36.320
come from?

41:36.400 --> 41:37.159
Effective immediately,

41:37.360 --> 41:38.800
strip Zhao Ling of all his posts

41:38.800 --> 41:39.679
and reduce him to a commoner.

41:39.960 --> 41:40.800
Now,

41:41.039 --> 41:42.360
the court is in turmoil,

41:42.679 --> 41:44.400
and the people
are seething with resentment.

41:44.639 --> 41:45.599
Fu,

41:46.199 --> 41:47.360
do you acknowledge your crimes?

42:00.800 --> 42:05.120
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

42:08.720 --> 42:13.080
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

42:15.200 --> 42:19.840
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

42:20.080 --> 42:22.880
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

42:24.040 --> 42:28.680
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

42:31.880 --> 42:38.720
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

42:39.600 --> 42:46.120
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

42:47.080 --> 42:50.520
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:51.040 --> 42:55.240
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:55.520 --> 43:01.200
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

43:13.320 --> 43:17.200
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

43:21.120 --> 43:25.120
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

43:26.840 --> 43:31.520
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

43:31.840 --> 43:34.520
♪Kept close within my heart♪

43:35.600 --> 43:40.440
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

43:43.960 --> 43:50.880
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

43:51.760 --> 43:58.240
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

43:59.120 --> 44:02.640
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

44:03.080 --> 44:07.440
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

44:07.640 --> 44:13.360
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
